# Best of
// 'total' is the only score modifier (E013)
score: load, best
Max load
  1 Deadlift

# Nothing to add
// 'none' has nothing to add up (E013)
score: none, total
For time
  100 Burpee

# A lift and a metcon
// every part of a total is measured by its value (E036, on the part)
score: load, total
Max load, 3 attempts
  1 Deadlift
AMRAP 6:00
  10 Burpee
